abstract: >-
  A standalone holographic search system using Fourier Transform-based
  Holographic Reduced Representations (HRR) for local retrieval-augmented
  generation. Features 2-stage search with centroid project ranking and
  768D cosine file recovery, BM25 keyword search, hybrid vector+keyword
  fusion, multi-bank binding, key orthogonalization, and CORVACS-lite
  signal processing.
